   "text": "Live, exact state. Every write is a reducer call: one\ntransaction, all or nothing. Each change is pushed to\nevery subscribed screen. Scheduled reducers\n(venue_tick, memory_tick) derive zone state and\nhistory inside the database.",
   "originalText": "Live, exact state. Every write is a reducer call: one\ntransaction, all or nothing. Each change is pushed to\nevery subscribed screen. Scheduled reducers\n(venue_tick, memory_tick) derive zone state and\nhistory inside the database.",
