   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1792828800000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Runs once before the event from any event's public pages (Cal Hacks 13.0 is the first run), so no live step waits on a scrape. Bright Data does every fetch, Rust does\nthe deterministic stages, Elastic organizes, and SpacetimeDB loads the checked bundle in one transaction.",
   "originalText": "Runs once before the event from any event's public pages (Cal Hacks 13.0 is the first run), so no live step waits on a scrape. Bright Data does every fetch, Rust does\nthe deterministic stages, Elastic organizes, and SpacetimeDB loads the checked bundle in one transaction.",
   "fontSize": 20,
   "fontFamily": 5,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
