   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "An incident becomes a claim with no form. The venue's liability policy pays. Claude reads the bill and judges causation, but never sees or sets an amount: code prices\nevery line and decides the route. A judge's approval teaches a rule that settles the next similar claim by itself.",
   "originalText": "An incident becomes a claim with no form. The venue's liability policy pays. Claude reads the bill and judges causation, but never sees or sets an amount: code prices\nevery line and decides the route. A judge's approval teaches a rule that settles the next similar claim by itself.",
   "fontSize": 20,
   "fontFamily": 5,
