   "text": "Live-learning demo",
   "originalText": "Live-learning demo",
   "fontSize": 22,
   "fontFamily": 5,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "te294",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 62,
   "y": 5711.5,
   "width": 1150,
   "height": 150.0,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": "frame201",
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 1098558008,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 55938963,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1792828800000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "1. The fall from the demo becomes a claim. No rule exists yet, so it waits for a judge playing risk\nmanager on their own phone.\n2. A late note makes the first tap fail as stale; the judge approves again. The payout lands in the\nwallet and rule v1 is created with the judge's name on it.\n3. A similar fall from the simulator settles in seconds under rule v1.\n4. A fake with witnesses in another zone is refused with every check listed.",
   "originalText": "1. The fall from the demo becomes a claim. No rule exists yet, so it waits for a judge playing risk\nmanager on their own phone.\n2. A late note makes the first tap fail as stale; the judge approves again. The payout lands in the\nwallet and rule v1 is created with the judge's name on it.\n3. A similar fall from the simulator settles in seconds under rule v1.\n4. A fake with witnesses in another zone is refused with every check listed.",
   "fontSize": 20,
   "fontFamily": 5,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "re295",
   "type": "rectangle",
   "x": 1260,
   "y": 5646.0,
   "width": 1260,
   "height": 239.5,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#c92a2a",
   "backgroundColor": "#ffe3e3",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
